Add this to your MCP config (`.mcp.json` or Claude Desktop settings):

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "github": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],
      "env": {"GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "<your token>"}
    }
  }
}
```

Enter your personal access token in the env block.
